sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI as VerifySubcommand
    participant RA as RequestAgent
    participant Server as VerifyHandler
    participant Engine as PipelineConfig

    User->>CLI: cicd verify .pipelines/success.yaml
    CLI->>CLI: Files.readString(path)
    CLI->>RA: postVerifyWorker(yamlContent)
    RA->>Server: POST /api/pipelines/verify<br/>Content-Type: text/plain<br/>Body: yaml content
    Server->>Engine: PipelineConfig.fromYamlString(body)
    Engine-->>Server: PipelineConfig (valid/messages)
    Server-->>RA: 200 {"valid": true, "messages": [...]}
    RA-->>CLI: response stored in MESSAGES
    CLI-->>User: Verification results
